Added in '''Beta 30.0''', its ATK was increased from 3 to 4 in '''Beta 34.0'''. '''Beta 36.1''' buffed both it and Clean Rabbick by making its Turbo add CR to your hand and dropping CR's cost from 1G to 0G to keep it a free monster, but now giving the player the choice as to when and where to play it.

=== Stats ===
ATK:
* 3 (Post Beta 30.0)
* 4 (Post Beta 34.0, Current)
HP: 3

Cost: 4

Abilities:
* Turbo & Dust: Summon a Clean Rabbick. (Post Beta 30.0)
* Turbo: Add a Clean Rabbick to your hand. Dust: Summon a Clean Rabbick. (Post Beta 36.1, Current)

Rarity: White (Common)
